{"id":"geography-p011","bookId":"geography","number":11,"title":"八、中国的地势与地形","width":1190.55,"height":841.89,"image":"data/knowledge/pages/geography/geography-p011.svg","dataUrl":"data/knowledge/pages/geography/geography-p011.json","questionCount":10,"version":1,"imagePixels":[2084,1474],"source":{"file":"27上岸村·地理常识思维导图.pdf","sha256":"576c24491978fba592409bedecc27d6a415071de09308954a9b57b19ed8093f2","page":11},"nodes":[{"id":"geography-p011-n0001","text":"八、中国的地势与地形","bbox":[74.088,280.85,171.814,17.181],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.181,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0002","text":"地势","bbox":[330.695,128.799,30.545,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":1,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0003","text":"我国地势","bbox":[397.511,35.256,61.089,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0004","text":"西高东低","bbox":[458.6,35.256,61.089,15.272],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":15.272,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0005","text":"，大致呈三级阶梯状分布","bbox":[519.69,35.256,167.996,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0006","text":"第一阶梯","bbox":[397.511,79.164,61.089,15.272],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":15.272,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0007","text":"平均海拔","bbox":[494.872,79.164,61.089,15.272],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":15.272,"block":3,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0008","text":"4000","bbox":[555.961,73.447,45.359,15.272],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":15.272,"block":3,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0009","text":"米以上，分布着青藏高原、柴达木盆地","bbox":[601.309,79.164,259.637,15.547],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":15.272,"block":3,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0010","text":"第二阶梯","bbox":[397.511,150.753,61.089,15.272],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":15.272,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0011","text":"平均海拔","bbox":[494.872,127.845,61.089,15.272],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":15.272,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0012","text":"1000—2000","bbox":[555.961,122.128,92.642,15.272],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":15.272,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0013","text":"米，分布着内蒙古高原、黄土高原、","bbox":[648.572,127.845,244.365,15.547],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":15.272,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0014","text":"云贵高原、准噶尔盆地、四川盆地、塔里木盆地","bbox":[494.872,150.753,320.719,15.272],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":15.272,"block":5,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0015","text":"第三阶梯","bbox":[397.511,222.342,61.089,15.272],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":15.272,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0016","text":"大部分海拔在","bbox":[494.872,199.434,91.634,15.272],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":15.272,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0017","text":"500","bbox":[586.506,193.717,35.019,15.272],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":15.272,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0018","text":"米以下，分布着东北平原、华北平原、","bbox":[621.518,199.434,259.637,15.547],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":15.272,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0019","text":"长江中下游平原、辽东丘陵、山东丘陵、东南丘陵","bbox":[494.872,222.342,335.991,15.272],"color":"#ce4289","fontSize":15.272,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0020","text":"地形","bbox":[330.695,398.079,30.545,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0021","text":"我国地形复杂多样，山区面积广大，占陆地总面积的","bbox":[397.511,269.114,351.263,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0022","text":"三分之二","bbox":[748.774,269.114,61.089,15.272],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":15.272,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0023","text":"。在山地中，镶嵌着高原、盆地、平原和丘陵等","bbox":[809.864,269.114,320.719,15.272],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.272,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p011-n0024","text":"11","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"color":"#000000","fontSize":16.0,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"page-number"},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n001","text":"青藏高原","bbox":[473.023,324.58,60.504,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999483},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n002","text":"世界海拔最高的高原，被称为“世界屋脊”“世界第三极”。","bbox":[568.458,323.333,378.619,20.584],"color":"#141414","fontSize":20.584,"block":10004,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998091},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n003","text":"四","bbox":[415.014,339.55,16.841,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":2,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999972},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n004","text":"大","bbox":[413.766,361.382,18.713,19.96],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.96,"block":10004,"line":3,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999762},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n005","text":"内蒙古高原","bbox":[465.538,358.887,75.474,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":4,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999786},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n006","text":"称为“瀚海”，我国最平坦的高原，有典型的风蚀地貌。","bbox":[569.081,358.887,369.263,16.218],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.218,"block":10004,"line":5,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998645},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n007","text":"高","bbox":[413.766,385.085,18.713,19.336],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.336,"block":10004,"line":6,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998908},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n008","text":"黄土高原","bbox":[472.399,390.698,61.128,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":7,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.99819},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n009","text":"世界黄土分布最广，流水侵蚀，地表千沟万壑。","bbox":[600.269,391.946,308.135,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":8,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.996279},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n010","text":"原","bbox":[413.766,407.54,19.336,19.96],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.96,"block":10004,"line":9,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999739},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n011","text":"云贵高原","bbox":[473.023,424.381,60.504,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":10,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999791},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n012","text":"喀斯特地貌发育典型，地势崎岖不平，有许多“坝子”。","bbox":[569.081,424.381,369.887,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":11,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.99391},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n013","text":"我国面积最大的盆地、最大的内流盆地。分布有塔克拉玛","bbox":[570.329,453.698,376.124,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":12,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999595},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n014","text":"塔里木盆地","bbox":[464.914,464.925,74.851,14.97],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.97,"block":10004,"line":13,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.996894},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n015","text":"干沙漠（我国面积最大的沙漠，世界第二大流动沙漠）。","bbox":[569.705,475.529,371.758,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":14,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999381},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n016","text":"四","bbox":[415.014,492.994,16.841,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":15,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999963},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n017","text":"准噶尔盆地","bbox":[464.914,504.222,75.474,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":16,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999291},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n018","text":"我国位置最北、纬度最高的盆地，有典型的风蚀雅丹地貌。","bbox":[570.953,505.469,374.877,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":17,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998787},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n019","text":"大","bbox":[414.39,515.449,17.465,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":18,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999775},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n020","text":"盆","bbox":[413.766,537.281,18.713,19.96],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.96,"block":10004,"line":19,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999645},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n021","text":"我国地势最高的盆地，有盐、石油、煤以及多种金属矿藏，","bbox":[570.329,533.538,375.5,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":20,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.99903},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n022","text":"柴达木盆地","bbox":[465.538,544.766,74.227,15.594],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.594,"block":10004,"line":21,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.99801},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n023","text":"地","bbox":[413.143,560.36,19.336,19.336],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.336,"block":10004,"line":22,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999993},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n024","text":"被称为“聚宝盆”，有风蚀雅丹地貌。","bbox":[631.457,557.241,247.631,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":23,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998869},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n025","text":"我国四大盆地中地势最低的盆地、我国最大的外流盆地，","bbox":[569.081,579.072,369.263,16.841],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.841,"block":10004,"line":24,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998036},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n026","text":"四川盆地","bbox":[472.399,590.3,61.128,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":25,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999856},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n027","text":"被称为“红色盆地”“紫色盆地”。","bbox":[637.071,601.528,234.532,18.089],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.089,"block":10004,"line":26,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.988933},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n028","text":"我国面积最大的平原，地跨黑、吉、辽和内蒙古四个省区，","bbox":[569.705,627.725,375.5,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":27,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999086},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n029","text":"东北平原","bbox":[473.023,648.933,61.128,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":28,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999977},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n030","text":"由三江平原、松嫩平原（面积最大）、辽河平原组成。这","bbox":[570.329,650.804,376.124,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":29,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999449},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n031","text":"三","bbox":[415.014,661.408,16.841,18.089],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.089,"block":10004,"line":30,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999916},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n032","text":"是全球仅有的三大黑土区域之一。","bbox":[644.556,672.012,220.185,18.089],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.089,"block":10004,"line":31,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998887},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n033","text":"大","bbox":[413.143,681.992,19.96,21.208],"color":"#141414","fontSize":21.208,"block":10004,"line":32,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999709},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n034","text":"跨越京、津、冀、鲁、豫、皖、苏7省市，又称黄淮海平","bbox":[569.081,696.962,377.372,16.218],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.218,"block":10004,"line":33,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999488},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n035","text":"平","bbox":[413.766,706.318,19.336,19.96],"color":"#141414","fontSize":19.96,"block":10004,"line":34,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999968},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n036","text":"华北平原","bbox":[472.399,707.566,61.128,17.465],"color":"#141414","fontSize":17.465,"block":10004,"line":35,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999973},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n037","text":"原，由黄河、淮河、海河等含沙量河流合力冲积而成。","bbox":[577.19,720.041,356.164,16.218],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.218,"block":10004,"line":36,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999593},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n038","text":"原","bbox":[413.766,729.397,19.336,18.713],"color":"#141414","fontSize":18.713,"block":10004,"line":37,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999781},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n039","text":"地跨鄂、湘、赣、皖、苏、浙、沪等7省市，湖泊密布，","bbox":[570.329,744.367,368.639,14.346],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.346,"block":10004,"line":38,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.998787},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n040","text":"长江中下游平原","bbox":[451.192,755.595,104.167,14.97],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.97,"block":10004,"line":39,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999922},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-n041","text":"素有“鱼米之乡”“水乡泽国”的美誉。","bbox":[622.1,766.823,266.967,16.218],"color":"#141414","fontSize":16.218,"block":10004,"line":40,"emphasis":false,"role":"content","sourceKind":"ocr","sourceImageId":"geography-p011-r01","confidence":0.999369}],"blocks":[{"id":"geography-p011-b0001","text":"八、中国的地势与地形","bbox":[74.088,280.85,171.814,17.181],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0001"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0002","text":"地势","bbox":[330.695,128.799,30.545,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0002"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0003","text":"我国地势西高东低，大致呈三级阶梯状分布","bbox":[397.511,35.256,290.175,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0003","geography-p011-n0004","geography-p011-n0005"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0004","text":"第一阶梯平均海拔4000米以上，分布着青藏高原、柴达木盆地","bbox":[397.511,73.447,463.435,21.264],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0006","geography-p011-n0007","geography-p011-n0008","geography-p011-n0009"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0005","text":"第二阶梯","bbox":[397.511,150.753,61.089,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0010"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0006","text":"平均海拔1000—2000米，分布着内蒙古高原、黄土高原、云贵高原、准噶尔盆地、四川盆地、塔里木盆地","bbox":[494.872,122.128,398.065,43.897],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0011","geography-p011-n0012","geography-p011-n0013","geography-p011-n0014"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0007","text":"第三阶梯","bbox":[397.511,222.342,61.089,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0015"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0008","text":"大部分海拔在500米以下，分布着东北平原、华北平原、","bbox":[494.872,193.717,386.283,21.264],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0016","geography-p011-n0017","geography-p011-n0018"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0009","text":"长江中下游平原、辽东丘陵、山东丘陵、东南丘陵","bbox":[494.872,222.342,335.991,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0019"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0010","text":"地形","bbox":[330.695,398.079,30.545,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0020"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0011","text":"我国地形复杂多样，山区面积广大，占陆地总面积的三分之二。在山地中，镶嵌着高原、盆地、平原和丘陵等","bbox":[397.511,269.114,733.072,15.272],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0021","geography-p011-n0022","geography-p011-n0023"]},{"id":"geography-p011-b0012","text":"11","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0024"]},{"id":"geography-p011-r01-block","text":"青藏高原\n世界海拔最高的高原，被称为“世界屋脊”“世界第三极”。\n四\n大\n内蒙古高原\n称为“瀚海”，我国最平坦的高原，有典型的风蚀地貌。\n高\n黄土高原\n世界黄土分布最广，流水侵蚀，地表千沟万壑。\n原\n云贵高原\n喀斯特地貌发育典型，地势崎岖不平，有许多“坝子”。\n我国面积最大的盆地、最大的内流盆地。分布有塔克拉玛\n塔里木盆地\n干沙漠（我国面积最大的沙漠，世界第二大流动沙漠）。\n四\n准噶尔盆地\n我国位置最北、纬度最高的盆地，有典型的风蚀雅丹地貌。\n大\n盆\n我国地势最高的盆地，有盐、石油、煤以及多种金属矿藏，\n柴达木盆地\n地\n被称为“聚宝盆”，有风蚀雅丹地貌。\n我国四大盆地中地势最低的盆地、我国最大的外流盆地，\n四川盆地\n被称为“红色盆地”“紫色盆地”。\n我国面积最大的平原，地跨黑、吉、辽和内蒙古四个省区，\n东北平原\n由三江平原、松嫩平原（面积最大）、辽河平原组成。这\n三\n是全球仅有的三大黑土区域之一。\n大\n跨越京、津、冀、鲁、豫、皖、苏7省市，又称黄淮海平\n平\n华北平原\n原，由黄河、淮河、海河等含沙量河流合力冲积而成。\n原\n地跨鄂、湘、赣、皖、苏、浙、沪等7省市，湖泊密布，\n长江中下游平原\n素有“鱼米之乡”“水乡泽国”的美誉。","bbox":[399.42,310.234,559.508,483.41],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n001","geography-p011-r01-n002","geography-p011-r01-n003","geography-p011-r01-n004","geography-p011-r01-n005","geography-p011-r01-n006","geography-p011-r01-n007","geography-p011-r01-n008","geography-p011-r01-n009","geography-p011-r01-n010","geography-p011-r01-n011","geography-p011-r01-n012","geography-p011-r01-n013","geography-p011-r01-n014","geography-p011-r01-n015","geography-p011-r01-n016","geography-p011-r01-n017","geography-p011-r01-n018","geography-p011-r01-n019","geography-p011-r01-n020","geography-p011-r01-n021","geography-p011-r01-n022","geography-p011-r01-n023","geography-p011-r01-n024","geography-p011-r01-n025","geography-p011-r01-n026","geography-p011-r01-n027","geography-p011-r01-n028","geography-p011-r01-n029","geography-p011-r01-n030","geography-p011-r01-n031","geography-p011-r01-n032","geography-p011-r01-n033","geography-p011-r01-n034","geography-p011-r01-n035","geography-p011-r01-n036","geography-p011-r01-n037","geography-p011-r01-n038","geography-p011-r01-n039","geography-p011-r01-n040","geography-p011-r01-n041"],"sourceKind":"ocr"}],"questions":[{"id":"geography-p011-q001","number":1,"type":"fill-in","answer":"西高东低","bbox":[458.6,35.256,61.089,15.272],"fontSize":15.272,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"西高东低","bbox":[458.6,35.256,61.089,15.272],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0004"],"aliases":[],"context":"我国地势____，大致呈三级阶梯状分布"},{"id":"geography-p011-q002","number":2,"type":"fill-in","answer":"第一阶梯","bbox":[397.511,79.164,61.089,15.272],"fontSize":15.272,"color":"#1e88e5","segments":[{"text":"第一阶梯","bbox":[397.511,79.164,61.089,15.272],"color":"#1e88e5"}],"nodeIds":["geography-p011-n0006"],"aliases":[],"context":"____"},{"id":"geography-p011-q003","number":3,"type":"fill-in","answer":"平均海拔4000米以上，分布着青藏高原、柴达木盆地","bbox":[494.872,73.447,366.074,21.264],"fontSize":15.272,"color":"#1e88e5","segments":[{"text":"平均海拔","bbox":[494.872,79.164,61.089,15.272],"color