375,46.782]},{"row":7,"column":2,"text":"我国四大盆地中地势最低的盆地、我国最大的外流盆地，\n被称为“红色盆地”“紫色盆地”。","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n025","geography-p011-r01-n027"],"bbox":[565.027,575.018,386.104,46.782]},{"row":7,"column":1,"text":"四川盆地","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n026"],"bbox":[439.652,575.018,125.375,46.782]},{"row":8,"column":2,"text":"我国面积最大的平原，地跨黑、吉、辽和内蒙古四个省区，\n由三江平原、松嫩平原（面积最大）、辽河平原组成。这\n是全球仅有的三大黑土区域之一。","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n028","geography-p011-r01-n030","geography-p011-r01-n032"],"bbox":[565.027,621.8,386.104,70.484]},{"row":8,"column":1,"text":"东北平原","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n029"],"bbox":[439.652,621.8,125.375,70.484]},{"row":8,"column":0,"text":"三","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n031"],"bbox":[405.969,621.8,33.683,70.484]},{"row":9,"column":0,"text":"大\n平\n原","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n033","geography-p011-r01-n035","geography-p011-r01-n038"],"bbox":[405.969,692.284,33.683,46.782]},{"row":9,"column":2,"text":"跨越京、津、冀、鲁、豫、皖、苏7省市，又称黄淮海平\n原，由黄河、淮河、海河等含沙量河流合力冲积而成。","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n034","geography-p011-r01-n037"],"bbox":[565.027,692.284,386.104,46.782]},{"row":9,"column":1,"text":"华北平原","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n036"],"bbox":[439.652,692.284,125.375,46.782]},{"row":10,"column":2,"text":"地跨鄂、湘、赣、皖、苏、浙、沪等7省市，湖泊密布，\n素有“鱼米之乡”“水乡泽国”的美誉。","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n039","geography-p011-r01-n041"],"bbox":[565.027,739.065,386.104,46.782]},{"row":10,"column":1,"text":"长江中下游平原","nodeIds":["geography-p011-r01-n040"],"bbox":[439.652,739.065,125.375,46.782]}],"method":"visible-grid-lines; merged cells keep source geometry"},"ocrDataUrl":"data/knowledge/ocr/geography-p011-r01.json"}],"kind":"mindmap","imageFallback":"data/knowledge/pages/geography/geography-p011.webp"}
